      "title": "Lecturer (UHM/College of Education/Special Education)",
      "description": "Lecturer (UHM/College of Education/Special Education) Location UH Manoa, Honolulu, HI Job Type Part-Time Temporary Job Number 2018-00089 Department University of Hawai'i at Manoa - College of Education Division Special Education Opening Date 02/26/2018 Position Number: PENDING Description Title: Lecturer (UHM/College of Education/Special Education) Hiring Unit: College of Education Location: Manoa Date Posted: February 26, 2018 Closing Date: Continuous Salary: Minimum of $1,671 per credit hour Other conditions: Lecturer applicant pool for future semesters; temporary, part-time work, as needed, contingent upon student enrollment, position availability and funding. May be for day, evening, or weekend offerings on- and off-campus. Must be able to travel to off-site locations. Selectee is required to complete the COE New Faculty orientation in the first year and pass a criminal background check and Title IX training. Duties and Responsibilities Teach various initial teacher licensure courses in the Department of Special Education (SPED); Supervise, mentor, and evaluate teacher candidates in field-based settings; Conduct field experience seminars and student teaching seminars; Evaluate candidates' lesson plans and field-based program assignments; Conduct midterm and end-of-semester conferences; Participate in collaborative relationships with mentor teachers, school administrators, and staff; Attend faculty meetings and other duties that the supervisor assigns. Minimum Qualifications Earned master’s degree in special education or related field from a college or university of recognized standing, or equivalent combination of graduate education and experience; Evidence of ability to teach effectively; Poise and good address for meeting and conferring with others; Ability to travel independently to various geographical locations in a timely manner. Requirements may be fulfilled by a valid Hawai'i Driver's License (class 3), comparable driver's license, 